        "Description": "Ah, your first official contract agent. Now i know that Sapienza is a great holiday destination but remember your there for killing not relaxing.\rThere is a Templar high ranking agent there called Valentino Verdi and we have intel that he is there to assassinate the organiser of the political rally so its down to us to put a stop to it.\rHe will have 2 other agents with him as backup in disguise.\rWe will hand you the intel and as always, good luck.",
